hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5428","It was narrated that 'Uqbah bin 'Amir Al-Juhani said:\"\"While I was leading the Messenger of Allah [SAW] on his mount on a military campaign"
"5429","It was narrated that 'Uqbah bin 'Amir Al-Juhani said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said to me: 'Say.' I said: 'What should I say?' He said: 'Say: He is Allah (the) One"
"5430","Abu 'Abdullah narrated that Ibn 'Abis Al-Juhani told him that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said to him: \"\"O Ibn 'Abis"
"5431","It was narrated that 'Uqbah bin 'Amir said:\"\"The Prophet [SAW] was given a gray mule which he rode"
"5432","It was narrated from 'Uqbah bin 'Amir that :He asked the Messenger of Allah [SAW] about Al-Mu'awwidhatain. 'Uqbah said: \"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] recited them when he led us in Salah Al-Ghadah (As-Subh)"
"5433","It was narrated from 'Uqbah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] recited them in the Subh prayer"
"5434","It was narrated that 'Uqbah bin 'Amir said:\"\"I was leading the Messenger of Allah [SAW] (on his mount) on a journey"
"5435","It was narrated that 'Uqbah bin 'Amir said:\"\"While I was leading the Messenger of Allah [SAW] (on his mount) in one of these mountain passes"
"5436","It was narrated that 'Uqbah bin 'Amir said:\"\"I was walking with the Messenger of Allah [SAW] and he said: \"\"O 'Uqbah"
"5437","It was narrated that 'Uqbah bin 'Amir said:\"\"I came to the Messenger of Allah [SAW] while he was riding"
"5438","It was narrated from 'Uqbah bin 'Amir that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"\"There have been revealed to me Verses the like of which has never been seen: 'Say: I seek refuge with (Allah) the Lord of the daybreak...' to the end of the Surah"
"5439","It was narrated that Jabir bin 'Abdullah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said to me: 'Recite"
"5440","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin Amr that:The Prophet [SAW] used to seek refuge (with Allah) from four things: From knowledge that is of no benefit"
"5441","It was narrated from 'Umar that:The Prophet [SAW] used to seek refuge with Allah from cowardice"
"5442","It was narrated that Shakal bin Humaid said:\"\"I came to the Prophet [SAW] and said: 'O Prophet of Allah"
"5443","It was narrated that 'Abudl-Malik bin 'Umair said:\"\"I heard Mus'ab bin Sa'd (narrate) about his father: 'He used to tech us five things"
"5444","It was narrated that Ibn Mas'ud said:\"\"The Prophet [SAW] used to seek refuge (with Allah) from five things: From miserliness"
"5445","It was narrated that 'Amr bin Maimun Al-Awdi said:\"\"Sa'd used to teach his children these words as a teacher teaches his students"
"5446","It was narrated from Anas that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-'ajzi"
"5447","It was narrated that Anas bin Malik said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] had supplications that he never omitted to recite. He used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-hammi"
"5448","It was narrated that Anas bin Malik said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] had supplications that he never neglected. He used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-hammi"
"5449","Anas said:\"\"The Prophet [SAW] used to say in his supplication: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-kasali"
"5450","It was narrated from Anas that:The Prophet [SAW] used to say: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-'ajzi"
"5451","Anas said:\"The Prophet [SAW] used to say in his supplication: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-kasali, wal-harami, wal-jubni, wal-bukhli, wa fitnatid-dajjali, wa 'adhabil-qabr (O Allah, I seek refuge in You from laziness, old age, cowardice, miserliness, the tribulation of the Dajjal and the torment of the grave.)\""
"5452","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] often used to seek refuge (with Allah) from debt and sin. I said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"5453","It was narrated that Shakal bin Humaid said:\"\"I came to the Prophet [SAW] and said: 'O Prophet of Allah"
"5454","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] often used to seek refuge (with Allah) from debt and sin. I said: 'O Messenger of Allah, how often you seek refuge from debt!' He said: 'Whoever gets into debt speaks and lies, and makes a promise and breaks it.'\""
"5455","It was narrated that Khalid said:\"\"Humaid narrated: 'Anas - bin Malik - was asked about the torment of the grave and about the Dajjal. He said: \"\"The Prophet of Allah [SAW] used to say: Allahumma"
"5456","It was narrated that Zaid bin Arqam said:\"\"I will not teach you anything but that which the Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to teach us. He said: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min al-'ajzi wal-kasali"
"5457","It was narrated from Anas that:The Prophet of Allah [SAW] said: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min al-'ajzi"
"5458","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: \"\"Allahumma"
"5459","Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Seek refuge with Allah from poverty"
"5460","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: \"Allahumma, inni a'udhu bika minal-faqri wa a'udhu bika min al-qillati wadh-dhillati, wa a'udhu bika an azlima aw uzlam (O Allah, I seek refuge with you from poverty, I seek refuge with You from want and humiliation, and I seek refuge with You from wronging others or being wronged.)\" Al-Awza'I contradicted him."
"5461","Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Seek refuge with Allah from poverty"
"5462","Abu Hurairah narrated that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"\"Seek refuge with Allah from poverty"
"5463","Muslim - meaning bin Abi Bakrah - narrated that:He heard his father say following the prayer: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-kufri wal-faqri"
"5464","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] often used to say these words in his supplication: 'Allahumma"
"5465","Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min al-arba': min 'ilmin la yanfa'u"
"5466","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-ju'I"
"5467","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-ju'i"
"5468","It was narrated from Anas that :The Prophet [SAW] used to say these supplications: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min 'ilmin la yanfa'u"
"5469","Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say in his supplication: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minash-shiqaqi wan-nifaqi"
"5470","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] often used to seek refuge (with Allah) from debt and sin. It was said to him: 'O Messenger of Allah! You often seek refuge from debt and sin?' He said: 'If a man gets into debt"
"5471","Abu Sa'eed said:\"\"I heard the Messenger of Allah [SAW] say: 'A'udhu billahi minal-kufri wad-dain. (I seek refuge with Allah from Kufr and debt.)' A man said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"5472","It was narrated from Abu Sa'eed that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"\"A'udhu billahi minal-kufri wad-dain. (I seek refuge with Allah from Kufr and debt.)\"\" A man said: \"\"Are you equating debt with Kufr?\"\" He said: \"\"Yes"
"5473","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin 'Amr bin Al-'As that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say these words in his supplication: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min ghalabatid-dain"
"5474","It was narrated that Anas bin Malik said:\"\"The Prophet [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-hammi wal hazani"
"5475","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min 'adhabil-qabri"
"5476","Mus'ab bin Sa'd said that :Sa'd used to teach him these words"
"5477","It was narrated that Mus'ab bin Sa'd and 'Amr bin Maimun Al-Awdi said:\"\"Sa'd used to teach his children these words as a teacher teaches his students"
"5478","It was narrated from 'Umar that:The Prophet [SAW] used to seek refuge with Allah from cowardice"
"5479","It was narrated that 'Urwah bin Maimun said:\"\"I heard 'Umar bin Al-Khattab say: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to seek refuge with Allah from five things and say: Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-jubni"
"5480","It was narrated that 'Amr bin Maimun said:\"\"The Companions of Muhammad [SAW] told me that the Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to seek refuge with Allah from stinginess"
"5481","It was narrated that 'Amr bin Maimun said:\"\"The Prophet [SAW] used to seek refuge.\"\" Mursal"
"5482","It was narrated that 'Amr bin Maimun said:\"The Companions of Muhammad [SAW] told me that the Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to seek refuge with Allah from stinginess, cowardice, the trials of the heart and the torment of the grave.\""
"5483","It was narrated from Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: \"\"A'udhu billahi minal-kufri wal-faqr. (O Allah"
"5484","It was narrated from Umm Salamah that :When the Prophet [SAW] went out of his house"
"5485","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin 'Amr bin Al-'As that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say supplication in these words: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min ghalabatid-dain"
"5486","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin 'Amr that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say supplication in these words: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min ghalabatid-dain"
"5487","It was narrated from 'Uthman bin Abi Al-'As that:The Prophet [SAW] used to say supplication in these words: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-kasali"
"5488","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin 'Amr that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say supplication in these words: \"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min ghalabatid-dain, wa ghalabatil-'aduwwi, wa shamatatil-a'da' (O Allah, I seek refuge with You from being overwhelmed by debt and from being overpowered by the enemy, and from the enemy rejoicing at my misfortune.)\""
"5489","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Prophet [SAW] used to seek refuge from these three: From being overtaken by destruction"
"5490","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that :The Prophet [SAW] used to seek refuge from being destined to an evil end"
"5491","It was narrated from Anas that:The Prophet [SAW] used to say: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-jununi wal-jadhami"
"5492","It was narrated that Abu Sa'eed said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to seek refuge from the evil eye of the Jinn and the evil eye of humans. When Al-Mu'awwadhatan were revealed"
"5493","It was narrated that Anas said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to seek refuge by saying these words: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-kasali"
"5494","It was narrated that 'Abdul-Malik bin 'Umair said:\"\"I heard Mus'ab bin Sa'd say"
"5495","It was narrated that 'Amr bin Maimun said:\"\"I went for Hajj with 'Umar"
"5496","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin Sarjis that :When the Messenger of Allah [SAW] traveled"
"5497","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin Sarjis that :When the Messenger of Allah [SAW] traveled"
"5498","It was narrated that 'Abdullah bin Sarjis said:\"\"When the Prophet [SAW] traveled"
"5499","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"When the Messenger of Allah [SAW] traveled and rode his mount"
"5500","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Seek refuge with Allah from a bad neighbor in one's permanent abode"
"5501","Anas bin Malik said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said to Abu Talhah: 'Find me one of your boys to serve me.' Abu Talhah brought me out"
"5502","It was narrated from 'Aishah that:The Prophet [SAW] used to seek refuge with Allah from the torment of the grave and the tribulation of the Dajjal"
"5503","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"\"A'udhu billahi min 'adhabi jahannama"
"5504","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min 'adhabil-qabri"
"5505","It was narrated that Abu Dharr said:\"\"I entered the Masjid and the Messenger of Allah [SAW] was there"
"5506","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"\"Seek refuge with Allah from the torment of the grave"
"5507","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to seek refuge with Allah from five things"
"5508","Abu Hurairah said:\"\"I heard the Messenger of Allah [SAW] say: 'Whoever obeys me has obeyed Allah and whoever disobeys me has disobeyed Allah.' And he used to seek refuge from the torment of the grave"
"5509","Abu Hurairah said:\"\"He (meaning the Prophet [SAW]) said: 'Seek refuge with Allah from five things: From the torment of Hell"
"5510","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin 'Abbas that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to teach them this supplication as he would teach them a Surah of the Qur'an: \"\"Say: 'Allahumma"
"5511","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"\"Seek refuge with Allah from the punishment of Allah"
"5512","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say in his supplication: \"\"Allahumma"
"5513","It was narrated from Sulaiman bin Yasar that he heard Abu Hurairah say:\"\"I heard the Messenger of Allah [SAW] say in his supplication: 'Allahumma"
"5514","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that :The Prophet [SAW] said: \"\"Seek refuge with Allah from the punishment of Allah"
"5515","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to seek refuge (with Allah) from the torment of Hell"
"5516","Abu Hurairah said:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"\"Seek refuge with Allah from the torment of the Fire and the torment of the grave"
"5517","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Allahumma"
"5518","It was narrated from Sulaiman bin Sinan Al-Muzani that he heard Abu Hurairah say:\"\"I heard Abu Al-Qasim [SAW] say"
"5519","It was narrated that Anas bin Malik said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Whoever asks Allah for Paradise three times"
"5520","It was narrated from Shaddad bin Aws that :The Prophet [SAW] said: \"\"The best of prayers for forgiveness is for a person to say: 'Allahumma"
"5521","It was narrated from 'Abdah bin Abi Lubabah that Ibn Yasaf told him that he asked 'Aishah"
"5522",""
"5523","It was narrated that Farwah bin Nawfal said:\"\"I asked the Mother of the Believers 'Aishah about what the Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say in his supplication. She said: 'He used to say: A'udhu bika min sharri ma 'amiltu wa min sharri ma lam a'mal ba'd (I seek refuge with You from the evil of what I have done and the evil of what I have not done yet)"
"5524","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma"
"5525","It was narrated that Farwah bin Nawfal said:\"\"I asked 'Aishah: 'Tell me of something that the Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say in his supplication.' She said: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: Allahumma"
"5526","It was narrated that Farwah bin Nawfal said:\"\"I said to 'Aishah: 'Tell me of a supplication that the Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say.' She said: 'He used to say: Allahumma"
"5527","Umar said:\"\"I heard the Messenger of Allah [SAW] say: 'Allahumma"
"5528","It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\"\"The Prophet [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma (O Allah"
"5529","It was narrated that Abu Al-Yasar said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minat-taraddi"
"5530","It was narrated from Abu Al-Yasar that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to supplicate and say: \"\"Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min al-harami"
"5531","It was narrated that Abu Al-Aswad Al-Sulami said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-hadmi"
"5532","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"\"I looked for the Messenger of Allah [SAW] one night in my bed"
"5533","It was narrated that 'Asim bin Humaid said:\"\"I asked 'Aishah with what the Messenger of Allah [SAW] would start Qiyam Al-Lail. She said: 'You have asked me about something that no one else has asked me about. He used to say Allahu Akbar ten times"
"5534",""
"5535","Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to say: 'Allahumma inni a'udhu bika min 'ilmin la yanfa'u"
"5536","It was narrated that 'Abdullah bin Al-Harith said:\"\"When it was said to Zaid bin Arqam: 'Tell us what you heard from the Messenger of Allah [SAW]"
"5537","It was narrated from Umm Salamah that:When the Prophet [SAW] went out of his house"
"5538","It was narrated from 'Umar that:When the prohibition of Khamr was revealed"
"5539","Anas bin Malik said:\"\"While I was taking care of a group of people"
